# review-shard-merge-mutants copies partition-review-diff.sh and merge-review-shards.sh (with their two script siblings) into per-mutant
# directories and rewrites one line of the copy. The predicates and seeds come from the sibling fixture's lib.sh and run.sh (declared whole);
# lib.sh reads the gate/role/grammar documents. The shard drivers are re-read by the coverage join (J0); a fixture's own directory is copied by the runner.
!core/scripts/partition-review-diff.sh
!core/scripts/merge-review-shards.sh
core/scripts/artifact-path-config.sh
core/scripts/partition-document.sh
core/skills/ai-dlc/artifact-path-grammar.md
core/skills/ai-dlc/steps/gate-validation.md
core/skills/ai-dlc/steps/implementation.md
core/team-roles/code-reviewer.md
core/team-roles/qa.md
core/fixtures/review-shard-merge/
core/fixtures/lib/
core/fixtures/review-shard-merge-mutants-b/run.sh
core/fixtures/review-shard-merge-mutants-c/run.sh
